25. Microsoft 365 Service Health

The Microsoft 365 Admin Center provides service-health information.

Help Desk scenario

If hundreds of users report:

"Teams is not working."

Before troubleshooting individual computers, check whether Microsoft 365 has a service-side incident.

Principle
Many users affected
↓
Check Service Health

This prevents unnecessary individual troubleshooting.
